# The kanbun.info comparison corpus (tests/kanbunInfoCorpus.test.ts). The 白文
# in it is out of copyright but the 書き下し文 beside it is that site's own
# editorial rendering, and this repository does not redistribute it: the corpus
# is built locally by scripts/build-kanbun-info-corpus.py and the suite skips
# where it is absent. The baseline next to these is *our* measurements — plain
# integers keyed by page slug, carrying none of the fetched text — and is
# committed, because a ratchet whose numbers are re-derived on every checkout
# ratchets nothing.
tests/fixtures/kanbun-info-passages.json
tests/fixtures/kanbun-info-parses.conllu
# The site's own furigana, pulled out of the same cache by the `ruby` stage and
# kept out for the same reason: it is that editor's reading of the text.
tests/fixtures/kanbun-info-ruby.json
